<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's December palm oil exports 717,197t - SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's December palm oil exports 717,197t - SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd said it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for December at 717,197 tonnes against 700,566 tonnes in November.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 216,995 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 244,663 tonnes of RBD palm olein and 72,983 tonnes of RBD palm stearin.  </p>
<p>China, which was the main buyer during the period, taking 106,400 tonnes, Pakistan 85,190 tonnes, India 68,722 tonnes and Japan 50,937 tonnes.</p>
<p>Countries in the European Union bought 120,212 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
